            "expected": "- `title` (short text, required)\n- `summary` (plain text). Shown in lists\n- `theme` (one of light, dark)\n- `kind` (one of project, guide)\n- `pageBuilder` (list of blocks)\n  Each block is written as `type: <block>` followed by that block's fields. Blocks:\n  - `hero`: Hero, on 100% of entries\n      (the same on every entry; write `type: hero` and nothing else)\n  - `longForm`: LongForm, on 100% of entries\n      - `content` (markdown)\n  - `cards`: Cards, on 100% of entries\n      (the same on every entry; write `type: cards` and nothing else)\n  - `related`: Related, on 100% of entries\n      (the same on every entry; write `type: related` and nothing else)\n  Also available but not normally used here: `gallery` (Gallery).\n\nEntries in this section usually build `pageBuilder` from these blocks, in this order: hero, longForm, cards, related. Follow that order unless the brief gives a reason not to.\nThese blocks are the same on every entry. Include each with its `type` alone, in its usual place, and its content is copied in for you. Never ask for their text: hero, cards, related."
